message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Energy Lens"
abstract: >-
  Energy Lens is a mobile-friendly web app for organizing industrial energy
  assessment field photos by site, equipment type, and piece of equipment.
  Photos are tagged, stored in the user's Google Drive, shared with teammates,
  and exported as PDF reports or ZIP archives.
